    ],
    "text": "Filling of a Vacancy in the Office of Member of the",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      185.52,
      383.4,
      403.74,
      417.48
    ],
    "text": "Uhana Pradeshiya Sabhaunder Section 66 A (1) of theLocal Authorities Elections Ordinance (Chapter 262)",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.96,
      431.36,
      464.35,
      441.44
    ],
    "text": "WHEREAS the office of member of Uhana Pradeshiya Sabha has fallen Vacant by reason of resignation:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.96,
      451.76,
      540.14,
      497.84
    ],
    "text": "AND WHEREAS the secretary of the United National Party the recognized political party to which Hewa UlawadugeSusantha the member belonged, was required by me under section 66A (1) of the aforesaid ordinance, to decide upon returnedmember if United National Party who belongs to such party and is not disqualified under section 9 of the Local AuthoritiesElections Ordinance and who shall be declared selected as a member within a period of thirty (30) days;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.96,
      511.76,
      540.11,
      533.84
    ],
    "text": "AND WHEREAS the secretary of the aforesaid recognized political party had communicated his decision to nominateRathnayake Mudiyanselage Jayaweera Rathnayake to fill such vacancy;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.96,
      547.76,
      540.08,
      581.84
    ],
    "text": "NOW THEREFORE R. Sasilan, returning Officer of the Uhana Pradeshiya Sabha acting in terms of section 66 A (1) of the LocalAuthorities Elections Ordinance (Chapter 262) do hereby declare that Rathnayake Mudiyanselage Jayaweera Rathnayake wasselected as the member of the Uhana Pradeshiya Sabha.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      362.4,
      595.76,
      527.58,
      629.84
    ],
    "text": "R. SASILAN Returning Officer, Uhana Pradeshiya Sabha.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.959303855895996,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
